# Supabase

- Schema source of truth: SQL migrations under `supabase/migrations/`.
- Every household-scoped table must have RLS: members of the same `household_id` only.
- Join-by-invite via RPC or controlled path; do not weaken RLS for convenience.
- Prefer generated/typed client usage; keep DB types in sync after migrations.
- Realtime subscriptions scoped to the current household.
- Never commit secrets. Anon key in Vite env is OK; service role is not for the SPA.
